      "id": 65557,
      "name": "JimmytheRat",
      "username": "JimmytheRat",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-06-10T16:49:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yep, highest and lowest can change multiple times in the middle of an action.&nbsp; It's assessed constantly.&nbsp; Tempest could theoretically get the benefit from Gene-Bound Shackles against EVERY target when using Squall, for instance, if they're close together in hp and he applies damage in the right order.&nbsp; Haka can do the same with Rampage and Punish the Weak, and so on.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:43:01.318Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
